%N A397679 a(n) is the number of tilings of a 8 X 5n rectangle into I-pentominoes.
%H A397679 Nicolas Bělohoubek, Karol Gryszka and Antonín Slavík, <a href="https://www.karlin.mff.cuni.cz/~slavik/papers/pentominoes.pdf">A Guided Tour to Pentomino Tilings</a>
%H A397679 <a href="/index/Rec#order_05">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (9,-10,10,-5,1).
%F A397679 a(n) = 9*a(n-1) - 10*a(n-2) + 10*a(n-3) - 5*a(n-4) + a(n-5), n > 4.
%F A397679 G.f.: (1 - x)^4/((1 - x)^5 - 4*x).
%F A397679 G.f.: (1 - x)^4/(1 - 9*x + 10*x^2 - 10*x^3 + 5*x^4 - x^5).
